## PART 2: API SPECIFICATION (Django REST Framework)

### 2.1 Authentication APIs

#### POST /api/v1/auth/register/
**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "phone_number": "+919876543210",
  "password": "SecurePass@123",
  "first_name": "Raj",
  "last_name": "Sharma",
  "role": "vendor"
}
```
**Response (201):**
```json
{
  "id": "uuid-xxx",
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "role": "vendor",
  "is_verified": false,
  "message": "OTP sent to registered phone/email"
}
```
**Error (400):**
```json
{
  "error": "Email already registered",
  "field": "email"
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp/
**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}
```
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "access_token": "jwt_token_xxx",
  "refresh_token": "refresh_token_xxx",
  "expires_in": 3600,
  "user": { "id": "uuid", "email": "...", "role": "vendor" }
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/login/
**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass@123",
  "2fa_code": "123456" (optional, if 2FA enabled)
}
```
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "access_token": "jwt_token_xxx",
  "refresh_token": "refresh_token_xxx",
  "user": { "id": "uuid", "email": "...", "role": "vendor" }
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/refresh/
**Request:**
```json
{
  "refresh_token": "refresh_token_xxx"
}
```
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "access_token": "new_jwt_token_xxx",
  "expires_in": 3600
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/logout/
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "Logged out successfully",
  "session_ended_at": "timestamp"
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/setup-2fa/
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "qr_code": "data:image/png;base64,...",
  "secret": "JBSWY3DPEBLW64TMMQ======",
  "backup_codes": ["code1", "code2", ...]
}
```

