### 2.2 Super Admin APIs (Role-Based Access)

#### GET /api/v1/super-admin/admins/
**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer jwt_token`, `X-User-Role: super_admin`
**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "count": 5,
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "user": { "id": "uuid", "email": "admin@example.com", "first_name": "Admin" },
      "vendor_access": ["all"], // or array of vendor IDs
      "permissions": { "can_onboard_vendor": true, "can_manage_customers": true, ... },
      "created_at": "2025-01-01T10:00:00Z",
      "assigned_at": "2025-01-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/super-admin/admins/
**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "phone_number": "+919876543210",
  "vendor_access": ["all"], // or ["vendor_id_1", "vendor_id_2"]
  "permissions": {
    "can_onboard_vendor": true,
    "can_manage_customers": true,
    "can_view_analytics": true,
    "can_moderate_offers": true
  }
}
```
**Response (201):**
```json
